# TestJavaToCSharpLangchain4j: langchain4j's core sources printed as C# by maddi-cst-print-csharp and judged by Roslyn
# (tools/csharp-check, Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp 5.0.0 on .NET 10; see JavaToCSharpRatchet's javadoc), the second
# corpus after fernflower. Lower is better for printerCrashes, syntaxErrors and unmappedJdkUses, higher for
# syntaxCleanFiles and compilingFiles; `types` must not move. Write a better value here in the commit that earns it.
#
# 2026-10-10, first record, with the printer as fernflower left it: 11 printer crashes (StackOverflowError), 57
# syntax errors in 11 files; 143 of 346 files compile; 1,249 errors (not ratcheted).
# 2026-10-10, an F-bounded type used raw (R extends GuardrailResult<R>) stops at its own erasure, which ended the 11
# crashes; a supplier argument a template calls is written in place (orElseGet(() -> x) is ?? x, orElseGet(List::of)
# is ?? new List<T>()); Optional.class: 0 crashes, 0 syntax errors, 151 files compile; errors 1,249 -> 1,374 and
# unmapped JDK uses 465 -> 670, as the 11 files that crashed are printed now.
# 2026-10-10, a namespace segment with a type's name is plural (Dev.Langchain4j.Exception hid System.Exception,
# Embedding, Query, Image, Tool: their types): 205 files compile; errors 1,374 -> 938.
# 2026-10-10, a default method called on a class goes through the interface; a cast to a type parameter through
# object; a method named as its class is Of (static) or <Name>Value; a type hidden by a member, or whose name two
# namespaces or the BCL declare, is qualified; an adapter substitutes a generic super-interface's arguments: 208 files
# compile; errors 938 -> 801.
# 2026-10-10, annotation types as attribute classes (8, which printed empty before), their uses as attributes, element
# reads as properties: errors 801 -> 793; the numbers do not move.
# 2026-10-10, a record with a canonical or compact constructor declares its properties and that constructor; an
# accessor implementing an interface method implements it explicitly: 209 files compile; errors 793 -> 791.
# 2026-10-10, List/Collection/Set/Iterable/Map of ? as C#'s non-generic IList/ICollection/IEnumerable/IDictionary
# (which a List<string> is, as a T extends Collection<?> needs): 214 files compile; errors 791 -> 772.
# 2026-10-10, interface implementations: a narrower return type implements the interface's method explicitly, a
# default method implements an inherited interface's method explicitly, an abstract class redeclares the interface
# methods it leaves (and its subclasses override them), clashing hoisted nested types are prefixed: 224 files
# compile; errors 772 -> 721.
# 2026-10-10, a type parameter named as a member of its type is T-prefixed (EmbeddingMatch<TEmbedded>), a method
# named as a nested type of its type with a field of its Java name is PascalValue (ResultValue()): 226 files compile;
# errors 721 -> 716.
# 2026-10-10, a method captures a parameter's wildcard X<?> of a program type as a type parameter of its own,
# void OnRequest<TEmbedded>(Context<TEmbedded> c), constrained by the wildcard's or the declared bound: 227 files
# compile; errors 716 -> 683.
# 2026-10-10, a type token Class<T> is the method's type argument when every call passes a known Class<X>
# (T FromJson<T>(string json), typeof(T) in the body, FromJson<Foo>(s) at the call): 230 files compile;
# errors 683 -> 666, CS0411 30 -> 9.
# 2026-10-10, a generic type's static members in a non-generic static companion class of the same name
# (Response.From(x) as in Java), Comparable<?> as IComparable, BCL templates writing a generic collection use its
# namespace: 233 files compile; errors 666 -> 636.
# 2026-10-11, the values of java.time, java.net and java.math as BCL structs (LocalDate is DateOnly, Duration
# TimeSpan, Clock TimeProvider, URI Uri, UUID Guid, BigDecimal decimal), Number as IConvertible, Random, Base64,
# HexFormat, MessageDigest, StringBuffer, Map.forEach, Stream.reduce: 251 files compile; errors 636 -> 443.
# 2026-10-11, CompletableFuture as Task (continuations with explicit type arguments, Task<T> being invariant),
# Executor/ExecutorService as TaskScheduler (a ThreadPoolExecutor the .NET pool), CountDownLatch as CountdownEvent,
# ReadWriteLock as ReaderWriterLockSlim, the atomics and lock halves in the compatibility library: 254 files
# compile; errors 443 -> 404.
# 2026-10-11, Class and java.lang.reflect as System.Type and System.Reflection: the kinds of reflect.Type are one
# Type told apart by property patterns (t is Type { IsConstructedGenericType: true } pt), a wildcard a compatibility
# interface no Type implements, annotations attributes (GetCustomAttribute<T>, IsDefined), modifiers Java's bits; an
# anonymous ParameterizedType of constants is a typeof (typeof(IDictionary<string, object>)): 256 files compile;
# errors 404 -> 323.
# 2026-10-11, a ServiceLoader as the implementations in the loaded assemblies (JavaServiceLoader.Load<T>(), an
# IEnumerable), a ClassLoader as an Assembly, a Path as a FileInfo (Java overloads on Path and String) with Files'
# reads on it: 263 files compile; errors 323 -> 292.
# 2026-10-11, library mappings for slf4j and Jackson, the default options: slf4j as Microsoft.Extensions.Logging
# (ILogger, messages as message templates whose holes are named after their arguments, a trailing exception first),
# Jackson as System.Text.Json (JsonSerializer with the mapper's options, the tree as JsonNode, annotations as
# attributes, @JsonSubTypes as JsonDerivedType); unmapped uses now count every library's: 271 files compile;
# errors 292 -> 232; unmapped 296 -> 154 (jackson 123: its framework configuration; jdk 28; slf4j 3, Marker).
#
# 2026-10-12, the type arguments Java infers and C# cannot (a method type parameter no parameter mentions, Value_
# getStore(int)) printed explicitly: 271 -> 273 compiling files, 232 -> 220 errors.
#
# 2026-10-12, companions of self-bounded types (CSharpCompanions) for their wildcards and raw uses: 273 -> 284
# compiling files.
#
# 2026-10-13, the JDK mappings that came with JAXB (java.net.URL, Class.getResource, Duration.parse/toString, Locale's
# language tags): 154 -> 153 unmapped uses.
#
# 2026-10-15, maddi 7717d7f4b, f9973dec2, f355bb80b: record patterns as property patterns, a record's equals as
# Equals(R? o) with its components' hash where it has no hashCode, and a class that implements a functional interface
# C# has as a delegate is the delegate's method group where one is expected: 284 -> 287 compiling files, 234 -> 231 errors.
# 2026-10-15, maddi b37c5502b, dbcbb02b5, d168e2f81, dc5f6622b, 76269400f, 6ddef0e0a, 88609dc66, a0af43409: an Integer
# into a template's own type parameter keeps its int?; an enum's or a struct's X? as an Integer's int? (Java's null
# fits), cast where C# has the value type; a companion's protected member internal; a record header's nested types
# qualified; an annotation's nested types printed; Class.getName()'s FullName a string?: 287 -> 289 compiling files,
# 231 -> 225 errors.
# 2026-10-16, maddi a42af1bb2, baada3a61, 0b33335c5, 32d01b41e, dc527276e: a TreeMap's or TreeSet's Comparator in
# Comparer.Create; an unbound wildcard of a program type, TupleLifecycle<?>, Node<?, ?, ?>, is the type's wildcard
# interface (ITupleLifecycle) where it declares every member the code reaches through it, as a self-bounded type's is: 289 ->
# 295 compiling files, 225 -> 220 errors.
# 2026-10-16, maddi 24c40feab, cf927219c, a2428aa4c, f0ca0e080: an enum printed as a class is IComparable by its
# ordinal; a method reference of a Long into a Function's R unboxes, (long) p0.Result(); a functional interface that
# extends a JDK one declares its method, bool Test(...), and is called by it: 295 -> 297 compiling files, 220 ->
# 218 errors.
# 2026-10-16, maddi f8701687b, 19081f381: a wildcard interface declares the fields read through it, as properties;
# none for a wildcard passed where its type is declared with arguments (getAttribute(Key<T>)): 297 -> 298 compiling
# files, 219 -> 201 errors.
# 2026-10-17, maddi a56ea13cd, 5e56fd4e8, b24b6ea8d: a class implementing Set itself extends JavaSet; contains,
# remove, containsKey, get of an Object test its type (ContainsObject, ...): unmapped JDK uses 153 -> 152.
# 2026-10-17, maddi 1798df741, 114195d54, 42976fa84: ListIterator, reflection's declared members, String strips,
# List's first/last; a generic default method implements the inherited interface's explicitly: 298 -> 299
# compiling files.
# 2026-10-19, maddi d62fc3f33, 3e3d94d4a: CompletableFuture completed and cancelled from outside, a shutting-down executor
# (JavaExecutorService), thread interrupts, TimeUnit: 299 -> 300 compiling files, 198 -> 197 errors, unmapped JDK uses
# 152 -> 151.
# 2026-10-19, maddi d31f0f731, e9a7e4927, 9680a9230: a raw cast into a parameterized target, an array of a type parameter as
# Object[], an array as varargs arguments, getMethod's types, Map.of()'s key notnull: 300 -> 301 compiling files, 197 -> 191 errors.
